\bf MODEL & \bf ALL & \bf DEPLOYED & \bf LEARNED & \bf BEST SINGLE \\
 & \bf LAYERS & \bf BLOCK & & \bf (out-of-fold) \\
\midrule
Qwen3-VL-2B & 36.6\% & 39.3\% & \gd{45.5\%} & 36.1\% \\
Qwen2-VL-7B & \bad{21.5\%} & 35.1\% & \gd{43.5\%} & 43.5\% (L21, all folds) \\
LLaVA-OneVision-7B & 20.4\% & 25.1\% & 26.2\% & 25.1\% \\
LLaVA-NeXT-7B & \bad{9.9\%} & 12.6\% & \gd{18.8\%} & 16.8\% \\
